==History==
2016
*The Mini P.E.K.K.A. [[Cards|card]] was added with [[Version History#Softlaunch on iOS (4/1/2016)|Clash Royale's game launch]] on 4/1/2016 {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 9/2/2016, the [[Version History#Chest Rewards & Card Balance (9/2/2016)|Chest Rewards & Card Balance Update]] increased the Mini P.E.K.K.A.'s Hitpoints by 3% {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 29/2/2016, the [[Version History#March 2016 Update (29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]] decreased the Mini P.E.K.K.A.'s Sight Range to 5.5 tiles (from 6 tiles) {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]] increased the {{Rarity|Rare}} card Level Cap to 11 (from 10) {{Balance|Buff}} and made the Mini P.E.K.K.A. able to be affected by all forms of pushback {{Balance|Nerf}}. The update also fixed the “range bug”, by decreasing the Mini P.E.K.K.A.'s Range to 1.05 tiles (from 1.5 tiles), but maintaining his effective Range {{Balance|Nerf}}. Additionally, the Mini P.E.K.K.A.'s deployment sound effect was changed {{Balance|Neutral}}.
2017
*On 11/8/2017, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (11/8/2017)|Balance Update]] increased the Mini P.E.K.K.A.'s Damage by 4.6% {{Balance|Buff}}.
2018
*On 24/1/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (24/1/2018)|Balance Update]] increased the Mini P.E.K.K.A.'s Hitpoints by 7% {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September 2018 Update (5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]] made {{Rarity|Rare}} cards start at Level 3 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 11) {{Balance|Neutral}}.
2019
*On 1/7/2019, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (1/7/2019)|July 2019 Update]] increased the Mini P.E.K.K.A.'s Range to 1.2 tiles (from 1.05 tiles), classifying his Range as "Melee: Medium" {{Balance|Buff}}.
2020
*On 7/4/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/4/2020)|Balance Update]] added a card render to the Mini P.E.K.K.A.'s card info screen {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 5/5/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/5/2020)|Balance Update]] decreased the Mini P.E.K.K.A.'s Range to 0.8 tiles (from 1.2 tiles), classifying his Range as "Melee: Short" {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 3/11/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/11/2020)|Balance Update]] decreased the Mini P.E.K.K.A.'s Attack Period to 1.7 seconds (from 1.8 seconds) {{Balance|Buff}}.
2021
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions Update (27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level Cap of all cards to 14 (from 13) {{Balance|Buff}}.
2022
*On 3/2/2022, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/2/2022)|Balance Update]] decreased the Mini P.E.K.K.A.'s Attack Period to 1.6 seconds (from 1.7 seconds) {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 1/7/2022, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (1/7/2022)|maintenance break]] changed the Mini P.E.K.K.A.'s card image {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022 Quarter 3 Update (26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]] added the Armor Breaker [[Card Mastery]] task for the Mini P.E.K.K.A. {{Balance|Add}}. It also fixed an issue where unlocking Mini P.E.K.K.A. caused all card previews to be stuck with a loading spinner {{Balance|Neutral}}.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card Evolution Update (19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]] increased the Level Cap of all cards to 15 (from 14) {{Balance|Buff}}.
2025
*On 8/1/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/1/2025)|Balance Update]] increased the Mini P.E.K.K.A.'s Damage by 5% {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]] decreased the Mini P.E.K.K.A.'s Damage by 3.05% {{Balance|Nerf}}. On the same day, his Damage was increased by 5% in a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (31/3/2025)|maintenance break]] {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 8/7/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/7/2025)|Balance Update]] increased the Mini P.E.K.K.A.'s Hitpoints by 5% {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 24/11/2025, the [[Version History#Level 16 Update (24/11/2025)|Level 16 Update]] increased the Level Cap of all cards to 16 (from 15) {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 1/12/2025, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (1/12/2025)|December 2025 Update]] added the Mini P.E.K.K.A.'s [[Heroes|Hero]] form {{Balance|Add}}.
2026

* On 12/1/2026, a [[Version History|Balance Update]] decreased the Mini P.E.K.K.A.'s Hitpoints by 3%  {{Balance|Nerf}}

